    <string name="popup_request_title">Welcome to Beillen APP</string>
    <string name="popup_request_message">To provide you with better service, the APP needs the following permissions. We will not track or record your location or sensitive information.</string>
    <string name="popup_request_detail">Nearby devices and location permissions: used to search for nearby devices and connect via Bluetooth</string>
    <string name="popup_privacy_title">User agreement and privacy policy</string>
    <string name="popup_privacy_link_text">User agreement and privacy policy</string>
    <string name="popup_privacy_intro">In accordance with the latest regulatory requirements, we would like to explain the Jiade user agreement and privacy policy as follows:</string>
    <string name="popup_privacy_body">1. To provide basic APP functions, we collect and use necessary information. 2. With your explicit authorization, we may obtain your location, user behavior, device information, and APP error events. You have the right to refuse or withdraw authorization. 3. We take necessary security measures to protect your information. The APP uses the device Bluetooth address to connect to the device. 4. The APP checks whether a map app is installed on your phone to provide navigation when finding a device. 5. The APP does not retain the information it obtains for a long time.</string>
